    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d223-a1-a2">

                <pb facs="0325" n="219" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg219"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure B.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The intendente of
                            Valparaiso to Capt. Schley</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Intendencia of Valparaiso</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Valparaiso</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-11-03"><hi rendition="#italic">November 3,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have had the honor to receive your note of this date, in which you were pleased
                    to inclose a list of names of persons cognizant of the facts which relate to the
                    unfortunate incident of the 16th of October past.</p>
                <p>I am pleased to inform you that your note has been transmitted to the judge of
                    crime, who, having in mind the rules of criminal procedure established by our
                    laws, will decide what to permit in order to satisfy the wishes manifested by
                    you.</p>
                <p>God guard you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. de Ds.
                    Arlegui</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
